2.20 emacsvox-aural-doctor
==========================

Diagnose the running aural installation and configuration without
starting a speech server or changing presentation state.  Safe,
deterministic repairs are explicit commands from the spoken report.

2.20.1 Emacsvox-Aural-Doctor Commands
-------------------------------------

2.20.1.1 emacsvox-aural-doctor
..............................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor

     Open the spoken Aural Doctor and announce its overall result.

2.20.1.2 emacsvox-aural-doctor-help
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-help

     Display and speak Aural Doctor help.

2.20.1.3 emacsvox-aural-doctor-mode
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-mode

     Spoken diagnostics for aural presentation.

     In addition to any hooks its parent mode
     ‘emacsvox-aural-tabulated-mode’ might have run, this mode runs the
     hook ‘emacsvox-aural-doctor-mode-hook’, as the final or penultimate
     step during initialization.

     Key             Binding
     -----------------------------------------------------
     ?		emacsvox-aural-doctor-help
     h		emacsvox-aural
     r		emacsvox-aural-doctor-repair-current

2.20.1.4 emacsvox-aural-doctor-next
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-next

     Move to and speak the next diagnostic finding.

2.20.1.5 emacsvox-aural-doctor-next-column
..........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-next-column

     Move right and speak the next diagnostic column.

2.20.1.6 emacsvox-aural-doctor-previous
.......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-previous

     Move to and speak the previous diagnostic finding.

2.20.1.7 emacsvox-aural-doctor-previous-column
..............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-previous-column

     Move left and speak the previous diagnostic column.

2.20.1.8 emacsvox-aural-doctor-refresh
......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-refresh (&optional id)

     Rerun diagnostics, preserving row ID and the current column.

     (fn &optional ID)

2.20.1.9 emacsvox-aural-doctor-refresh-sound-packs
..................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-refresh-sound-packs

     Refresh dynamically discovered and registered sound packs.

2.20.1.10 emacsvox-aural-doctor-reload-personal-data
....................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-reload-personal-data

     Reload the validated personal aural data file.

2.20.1.11 emacsvox-aural-doctor-repair-current
..............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-repair-current

     Run the deterministic repair offered by the finding at point.

2.20.1.12 emacsvox-aural-doctor-restore-bindings
................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-restore-bindings

     Restore the documented aural home and point-explanation bindings.

2.20.1.13 emacsvox-aural-doctor-speak-current
.............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-speak-current

     Speak the complete diagnostic finding at point.

2.20.1.14 emacsvox-aural-doctor-speak-current-cell
..................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-doctor-speak-current-cell

     Speak the current diagnostic column title and value.


