2.32 emacsvox-aural-provider-markdown
=====================================

Register Markdown structure and its compatibility presentation without
loading markdown-mode.  Live fact capture remains in
emacsvox-markdown.el.


File: emacsvox-reference.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-provider-notmuch,  Next: emacsvox-aural-provider-org,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-provider-markdown,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

2.33 emacsvox-aural-provider-notmuch
====================================

Register Notmuch-specific preview metadata without loading Notmuch.
Shared mail semantics and presentation options come from the workflow
provider.  Live fact capture remains in emacsvox-notmuch.el.


File: emacsvox-reference.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-provider-org,  Next: emacsvox-aural-provider-org-srs,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-provider-notmuch,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

2.34 emacsvox-aural-provider-org
================================

Register the lightweight Org compatibility fragment, curated preview
data, and optional Presentation Options before personal aural data is
loaded.  This file deliberately does not load Org itself; live semantic
fact capture remains in emacsvox-org.el.


File: emacsvox-reference.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-provider-org-srs,  Next: emacsvox-aural-provider-workflows,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-provider-org,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

2.35 emacsvox-aural-provider-org-srs
====================================

Register Org-srs review semantics without loading Org-srs.  Live review
feedback is implemented by emacsvox-org-srs.el after Org-srs is loaded.


File: emacsvox-reference.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-provider-workflows,  Next: emacsvox-aural-providers,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-provider-org-srs,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

2.36 emacsvox-aural-provider-workflows
======================================

Register the lightweight semantic vocabulary shared by the Notmuch,
Gnus, Dired, Magit, Shell/Comint, Agent Shell, Python, Vertico, BS,
Corfu, Tabulated List, and Solitaire integrations.  This file has no
dependency on those packages, so Presentation Options can validate at
startup before any integration is loaded.


File: emacsvox-reference.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-providers,  Next: emacsvox-aural-recent-feedback,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-provider-workflows,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

2.37 emacsvox-aural-providers
=============================

One explicit runtime selection boundary for sound packs and voice
palettes.  This preserves precedence while exposing which configuration
layer supplied the effective provider.


