2.73 emacsvox-company
=====================

COMPANY -mode: Complete Anything Support for emacs.  This module
provides an Emacsvox Company Front-end, And advises the needed
interactive commands in Company.  It adds an emacsvox-specific front-end
‘emacsvox-company-frontend’ to the value of company-frontends.  Note
that COMPANY-FRONTENDS is a user-customizable option and ends up getting
saved by emacs along with other custom settings.  Function
‘emacsvox-company-frontend’ handles providing spoken feedback, and
leaves it to other frontends on COMPANY-FRONTENDS to generate their own
feedback.


